<title>USA: CapStar Hotel to buy Albuquerque Doubletree.</title>
<headline>CapStar Hotel to buy Albuquerque Doubletree.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>CapStar Hotel Co said Monday it had signed a deal to buy the 294-room Doubletree Hotel in Albuquerque, N.M., from Merv Griffin Hotels, a unit of Griffin Group.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
